      "message": "The nested loop visitor in `loop_exceeds_nested_iteration_limit` is already processing the loop count in `statement`, as well as then visiting any additional nested loops, right?\n\nThat means we shouldn\u0027t need to gate this on having unrollInfo to pass in unrollInfo-\u003efCount, we can just pass in `statement`.",
